"locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-03T16:24:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T15:49:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120900","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120900","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120900.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120900.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Related https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3830\r\n\r\nScrolling vertically clips text, but scrolling horizontally does not. The letters just pop in and out when scrolling at the sides.\r\nClipping the text is pretty standard. It helps with clarity, clearly showing when text is cut off.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"473\" height=\"355\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/19cc63d7-ed70-443b-bee5-f0b2e7c59409\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"477\" height=\"360\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed85fb50-716c-414a-bf2b-0208d515d9b1\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds a new canvas item specifically for the text area. Effectively the old one is renamed to `clipped_ci` and the new one takes the `text_ci` name since this one is actually for the text.\r\nWe may want to expose it in the future, if the user wants to draw anything with the text it could be useful.\r\nThe clipped ci is on top so the code completion etc can be on top.\r\n\r\nThe current line highlight had to be split into 2 add rect calls, since it needs to go over the gutter but also be under the text.\r\n\r\nWhen the caret was at the end of the longest line, it looks like it was drawing outside of the line, on the minimap's padding or end margin. So I had to add it to the scrollbar total width calculation to make sure it is visible.\r\n\r\nIf you have a high content margin top or bottom, lines can pop in and out without being clipped scrolling vertically. I think they should be clipped too, but I didn't in this PR because that would make the top/bottom content margins visible by default when scrolling which seems unwanted. Maybe they should be set to 0 in the default and editor theme?\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120900/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120900/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}